@page "/"

<PageTitle>RouteTimer</PageTitle>

<h1>RouteTimer dashboard</h1>

<p>Train on your road rides, then predict moving time for a GPX route in calm, dry conditions.</p>

<section class="dashboard-grid" aria-label="RouteTimer status">
    <article>
        <h2>Rider profile</h2>
        <p>Set rider and bike/equipment mass before submitting predictions.</p>
        <a href="profile">Manage profile</a>
    </article>
    <article>
        <h2>Training evidence</h2>
        <p>Upload FIT activities with power data to learn your typical riding power.</p>
        <a href="training">Upload FIT files</a>
    </article>
    <article>
        <h2>Route prediction</h2>
        <p>Upload an elevation-bearing GPX route for a detailed moving-time estimate.</p>
        <a href="predictions">Predict a route</a>
    </article>
</section>
